    √ a name OUTSIDE the roster is somebody spoken ABOUT, never addressed (2 ms)
    √ a RECIPIENT behind the verb is never the addressee (4 ms)
    √ no roster ⇒ every frame is byte-identical to today (2 ms)
    √ an ITEM is never an addressee, roster or no roster (2 ms)
