    √ an explicit relation still wins: give apple to mara (2 ms)
    √ without a classifier, position decides: object first, argument last (4 ms)
    √ animacy over position: a NAMED creature before the verb is the agent (5 ms)
    √ movement to furniture: you go bed keeps bed as the destination noun (4 ms)
